# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Minescout workspace — local secrets
#
# Copy this file to `.env` in this same directory (the repo root) and fill it in:
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is git-ignored and must never be committed. Both server apps read it:
#   • chop-lab.com      — through scripts/with-app-env.mjs (dev, build, preview)
#   • life.minescout.net — through server/env.js (the dev server behind nginx)
# so SMTP is configured once for every site.
#
# A non-empty value here wins over your shell environment. Empty keys are
# ignored, so leaving a line blank never blanks a secret that is already set.
# On deploy there is no `.env`: the platform injects these values instead.
# Step-by-step walkthrough: EMAIL-SETUP.md
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Email (required) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Gmail account every site sends from. For Gmail, SMTP_PASSWORD must be a
# 16-character App Password, NOT the account password:
#   Google Account → Security → 2-Step Verification → App passwords → create
# (2-Step Verification must be on first.)
SMTP_USER=you@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=abcd efgh ijkl mnop

# Where Minescout leads and messages land (contact, studio consult, intake,
# SmartCut, beta, Life). Defaults to theminescout@minescout.net. Set it here to
# send them somewhere else, e.g. tmcarleton11@gmail.com.
# The Chop Lab is separate: its order copies go to tmcarleton11@gmail.com,
# set in chop-lab.com/src/lib/studio-mail.ts (STUDIO_EMAIL).
# STUDIO_INBOX=theminescout@minescout.net

# The display name on the From line for the Minescout sites.
# SMTP_FROM_NAME=Minescout

# Optional. Defaults to Gmail over STARTTLS. Use 465 for implicit TLS, or point
# at another provider's SMTP server.
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587

# ── Chop Lab invoice tool (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Passcode for /invoice. Leave blank to fall back to the old Apps Script check.
# STUDIO_PASSCODE=change-me

# ── Life server (optional, local only) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Admin sign-in and session cookies. Without SESSION_SECRET, sessions do not
# survive a dev-server restart; without ADMIN_PASSWORD, admin login is disabled.
# SESSION_SECRET=
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=
# Token for the MCP endpoint at /api/mcp. Unset disables the endpoint.
# MCP_TOKEN=
